sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Joiner as domain service or command
  participant User as UserService
  participant UserClient as UserApiClient
  participant UserApi as User API
  participant Directory as DirectoryService
  participant DirectoryClient as DirectoryApiClient
  participant DirectoryApi as Directory API
  Note over DirectoryApi: master system of the name
  Joiner->>+User: User()
  User->>+UserClient: User()
  UserClient->>+UserApi: GET /getUser
  UserApi-->>-UserClient: nameId 17, surname Lee
  UserClient-->>-User: nameId 17, surname Lee
  User-->>-Joiner: nameId 17, surname Lee
  Joiner->>+Directory: Name(17)
  Directory->>+DirectoryClient: Name(17)
  DirectoryClient->>+DirectoryApi: GET /names/17
  DirectoryApi-->>-DirectoryClient: "Ann"
  DirectoryClient-->>-Directory: Ann
  Directory-->>-Joiner: Ann
  Note over Joiner: joins the two answers
